{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>And also</b> — The sense: you did not bring sacrifices to me, nor your tithes, and behold my altar is empty — no burnt offering and no tithe for those who would offer. Therefore the sense of <b>and also I</b> — if you have done thus — also I have repaid your recompense upon your heads."], :book :amos, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Amos -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/amos"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:17:58.468991594Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}